      "updated": 1793750000000,
      "created": 1793750000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Agent] = Ask Kestrel does it    [Human] = a person decides or acts    [System] = existing module, unchanged\nGreen box = the BEFORE failure this step removes (numbers match BEFORE.md section 3). (*) = better fixed by configuration (AFTER_integration.md).\nRed box = BEFORE failure still not fixed. Arrows show order in time, not cause.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[Agent] = Ask Kestrel does it    [Human] = a person decides or acts    [System] = existing module, unchanged\nGreen box = the BEFORE failure this step removes (numbers match BEFORE.md section 3). (*) = better fixed by configuration (AFTER_integration.md).\nRed box = BEFORE failure still not fixed. Arrows show order in time, not cause.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
