      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Result for Aarav (estimates)\n- 12 days (2nd -> 14th May), was 46\n- Aarav's hands-on time about 40 min, was 1 h 35\n  min\n- Bank details typed once, was twice\n- 0 helpdesk tickets, was 1\n- EduDesk status always matches the bank",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "res",
      "originalText": "Result for Aarav (estimates)\n- 12 days (2nd -> 14th May), was 46\n- Aarav's hands-on time about 40 min, was 1 h 35\n  min\n- Bank details typed once, was twice\n- 0 helpdesk tickets, was 1\n- EduDesk status always matches the bank",
