      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Agent] 2nd May:\nverify_bank_account sends\nRs.1 to Aarav's current\naccount: OK. Finds the ERP\nstudent record still holds\nhis closed 2022 account, so\nit raises a bank-detail\nchange in the ERP with the\nproof attached",
