      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Agent] 12th May: reads the HR leave\nmodule (approved leave dates only): the\nonly signatory (Mr. Batra) is on leave\n15th-20th May, so the 15th May run would\nwait. Asks the finance head (Ms. Rao) for\nan off-cycle run on 14th May",
